Description:
  Only the VP9 loop-filter threshold calculation code is used. Over 99% of upstream
  libvpx is pruned (encoders, VP8, bitstream parsing, CPU deblocking filters).
Local Modifications:
  pruned unnecessary functions
  decoupled from VP9_COMMON
  added sharpness_updated_out output flag for Amlogic hardware register synchronization
